    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Cautus has never thought that oncoming doom, especially one pressing down on their neck, could be something to be accepted calmly."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#9$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I could never be so indifferent if I had to live through everyone and everything I love being destroyed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't understand how you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cosmicelfvoice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1720_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not indifference, but instead a belief in the absolute equality of the universe. It's a shame you arrived just a little bit late.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Elf"
    },
    {
        "text": "This ship had just encountered a star going supernova several thousand light-years away and made a smooth withdrawal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Elf"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you see that sight with your own eyes, perhaps you will understand my meaning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Elf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The instruments in the hall begin to spin rapidly, until they are moving too fast for the Cautus to see with the naked eye."
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, she sees a multitude of lights and shadows appear and float through the air."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see a giant sphere emitting a deep, dark red light, and a small indigo dot speeding across its surface.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... it seems like it's the big sphere rotating around the blue dot?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1720_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The one you call the 'blue dot' is the pulsar that just went supernova I mentioned.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Elf"
    },
    {
        "text": "The red star which is gradually being torn apart is its partner, now doomed to die as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Elf"
    },
    {
        "text": "They once harbored many interesting primitive lifeforms. I have many fond memories of wandering through the planets of that star system.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Elf"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a pity they were snuffed out before they could see the world beyond the sky.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Elf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Why are you showing this to me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1720_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Simply sharing the knowledge we have with you, traveler.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Elf"
    },
    {
        "text": "One-sided paranoia and ignorance are often barriers to effective information transfer. I have no knowledge of your history, either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Elf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Cautus has barely had the time to comprehend these words before suddenly, her newly-acquired knowledge begins to assault her mind."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The land... may see life be born twice? These stars fallen from the sky... can harbor life of their own?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ruination's end... is not despair.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're... not special, when it comes to the land?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1720_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A celestial body that can sustain life loves all that live upon it equally, no matter where they hail from. This is a law of nature.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Elf"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't be too greedy in lapping up that knowledge you can't fully understand yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Elf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I saw you among all that information. You once had many of your people by your side, but suddenly\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "'The Presence'. That's what a lot of people call you, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1720_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am just a wandering presence, true. Like I said, when true destruction bore down on me and my fellows, I was powerless.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Presence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What exactly is this destruction you keep talking about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've seen plenty of things here I can only describe as 'divine acts'. What could possibly threaten people like you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1720_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm afraid that nobody on this ship can answer your question, traveler.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Presence"
    },
    {
        "text": "In your eyes, we possess knowledge that many lifeforms in this universe would consider 'divine acts'...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Presence"
    },
    {
        "text": "But in this boundless cosmos, even we have limits to what we can explore and investigate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Presence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1720_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you disappointed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Presence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So there's definitely no eternal kingdom, a paradise where everyone can experience endless joy and happiness?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1720_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would you like such a place to exist?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Presence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Cautus hesitates for a moment before nodding."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1720_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing lives forever. Looking back through the history I know, I have come across legendary civilizations that have conquered countless star systems, spreading across the cosmos for millions of years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Presence"
    },
    {
        "text": "But as far as the universe cares, what they left behind was, in the end, utterly insignificant.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Presence"
    },
    {
        "text": "We once blindly chased after non-existent principles and ideals... In the midst of that golden age beyond recollection, we believed our existences to have a sure purpose.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Presence"
    },
    {
        "text": "But in the end?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Presence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1720_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Any lifeform born with intelligence insists on declaring itself the center of its world, but whether or not it is right, in the universe's eyes\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Presence"
    },
    {
        "text": "From start to finish, we are nothing. This is the first thing you must learn before you can understand it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Presence"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember that brilliant supernova you just saw?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Presence"
    },
    {
        "text": "From that tomb, life will be born anew, and there will come a day when those beings will understand what we have carved on our grave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Presence"
    },
    {
        "text": "That we once had lives of our own. That we existed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Presence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I don't understand anything that you're saying.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "How were we born on this land?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was there an even more glorious civilization here before us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are we going to be wiped out in the foreseeable future?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "But what I really want to know is, all this pain and suffering that Originium brings with it... Can it be eliminated?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "text": "I beg you, show me the way to the answers I seek...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1720_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't answer any of your questions. Your first three have been asked in a myriad of languages in a myriad of ways across the universe. Only you can answer them yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Presence"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for your final question... I'm terribly sorry, but I've never heard of this 'Originium', and I can't find anything related to it in our databases.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Presence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1720_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, I do know someone rather interesting, who also happens to be the master of this ship. Perhaps she will be able to solve your riddle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Presence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1719_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The master of this ship?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hierda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1720_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's a linguist of wide renown. Her name is\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Presence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
