        "name": "avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "No time to be lost in your thoughts, Doctor!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Grab onto me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "\u2014!;Did you see that, Amiya?",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't break my focus right now. Weaving together a way to the singularity is incredibly difficult.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if Theresa were here to help...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you see something, Doctor?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "......",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "You see a familiar figure."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
