    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Keep focusing, Amiya.;Stick to the plan.;Keep building that 'bridge'!",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will! I'm doing everything I can right now to stabilize the connection points, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresa has marked all the records Dr. Kal'tsit searched through earlier. I'm trying to link them all together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I still need an anchor point, one that can guide me back\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4134_cetsyr_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will keep watch here, and serve as your anchor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Civilight Eterna"
    },
    {
        "text": "Press onwards, Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Civilight Eterna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
