    },
    {
        "text": "Pink, silken threads begin to gather."
    },
    {
        "text": "The meandering threads interweave and spiral, gradually spreading out from the boundary into the distance."
    },
    {
        "text": "Beyond its walls, the path to the singularity slowly takes shape."
    },
    {
        "text": "It's working!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Originium Arts don't seem to work here, but applying the logic behind casting them to the information here does!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Can you build the 'bridge' using completely unknown information?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, this place is full of information I can't analyze, not even with the help of Civilight Eterna. I wouldn't have been able to make this way forward alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But thankfully, Dr. Kal'tsit's access left records, and with Theresa's help, I can grasp onto her research data.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's more than enough for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "The pink threads continue to slowly spiral, linking together the many pieces of complex data that Kal'tsit left her mark on."
    },
    {
        "text": "String by interwoven string, the path forward gradually forms."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'I can tell how you're feeling, Kal'tsit.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'By analyzing the emotional matrix I constructed of you without your permission, I see your tenseness is not only because of my sharing an appearance with Theresa. You have something even heavier on your mind.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'I will try to adjust. I don't want my personal emotional changes to interfere with the objectivity of those who come after me when they query these records.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'Yet they are still changing, Kal'tsit. Are you afraid?'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not the most efficient way to build a bridge, but it should hold.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm going to try to get closer to the singularity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I'll go with you.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'Yes, I'm afraid.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'I'm afraid Amiya and the Doctor won't be able to find the information I leave behind, and I'm afraid...'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'That if the situation worsens to the point that they are forced to take such extreme measures, the trail I cleared for them would no longer be of use...'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'Or that I might mistakenly lead these seekers of knowledge towards a threat I dare not speak of.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Doctor. I won't let you, not before I check its condition myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Amiya...",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, I know I'm being stubborn about it, but this is my decision.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "s",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_messagesuccess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "effect",
        "name": "$e_confusion_connect",
        "layer": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 5
    },
    {
        "tag": "bgeffect",
        "name": "$eb_confusion_loop",
        "layer": 3
    },
    {
        "text": "The bridge, formed from countless strands of entwined information, stretches out into the distance to touch upon the singularity."
    },
    {
        "text": "Without the slightest hesitation, Amiya steps onto it, her first step outside the walls of the boundary\u2014"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_messagewave"
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xScaleTo": 1.1,
        "yScaleTo": 1.1,
        "duration": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "60_i05",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A surge."
    },
    {
        "text": "...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "This feeling, it's like the information has formed some sort of great wave. But why\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "This is only the beginning, I'm afraid.;'The closer you get to the singularity, the denser the information will become.'",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "text": "It really is like Theresa said. The information here has mass.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll most likely find greater resistance the deeper we go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Come back for now, Amiya.;We need to come up with a better plan.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't maintain the stability of a bridge this weak. Going this deep has taken a greater toll than I expected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to keep going forward. As long as I follow Dr. Kal'tsit's beacons...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "The silver mountains the Teekaz had entered flit by her; the black shadow cast by the Feranmut plunging into icefield vanished momentarily."
    },
    {
        "text": "She sees more scenes fly past her, as if she were fighting the current of the river of time."
    },
    {
        "text": "More and more incomprehensible, indescribable sights assail her mind."
    },
    {
        "text": "She does her best to block out the unending, chaotic stream of information."
    },
    {
        "text": "Concentrate, Amiya, concentrate... Just keep focusing on Dr. Kal'tsit's beacons... Press onwards...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just need to touch the singularity\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
