    {
        "text": "Silence."
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya cannot even hear her own breathing."
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "What... is this place?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "That giant sphere... is disintegrating?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looking at the shattered sphere makes her feel dizzy, but it is the bizarrely-shaped ship floating in the air that causes an even greater bout of lightheadedness."
    },
    {
        "text": "What... is going on?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why am I seeing\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "As she is trapped in her spell of dizziness, a rotating boulder slowly but inexorably hurtles towards her."
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 3,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 40,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Its black shadow quickly fills Amiya's vision. She subconsciously tries to defend herself, but it is immediately followed by the feeling of freefall."
    },
    {
        "text": "Did she fail...? Was it a surge of information?"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Amiya!'"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Doctor...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I'm here.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$shatterpoint_02_intro",
        "key": "$shatterpoint_02_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya senses a hand supporting her, keeping her thoughts steady by bracing her."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Try to block out the interfering information.;I've got you.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
