        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You do your best to support her shaking body as the information wave surging from the singularity continues its assault."
    },
    {
        "text": "The information, so dense it has nearly taken true shape, washes over your thoughts, leaving behind jumbled afterimages in the void\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is the past long gone, the present being recorded en masse, and what seems to be the future, foreseeing your next steps."
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a shame that right now, you do not have energy to spare to pay it any heed."
    },
    {
        "text": "The two of you have already made the long, long, long trek from the boundary to this point without even noticing, and now, the singularity..."
    },
    {
        "text": "The singularity is right in front of you."
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you see that terrifying scene earlier, Doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I did.;I don't know what it means, though.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm certain it's not something that took place on Terra...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "But at least it means we're getting close to the singularity.;Even more information will show itself to us.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Can you still keep going, Amiya?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Y-Yes, yes I can.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "......",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You are well aware of the situation you are in right now. Despite knowing it will have minimal effect, you still subconsciously stretch out your arm to try and shield Amiya."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "The attacks here are focused on our thoughts. I can handle it.;I'll be the vanguard.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I've got a lead on what we're here for.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I've run the calcs on Kal'tsit's access records.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "You can read the key points from my mind.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Found them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Using 'Slumber Bridge' as a filter, Dr. Kal'tsit conducted a total of 79,346 searches...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Although all the searches are related to 'Originium', according to your speculation, this data is not strongly related to its actual essential nature.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the results are restricted and give us nothing, doesn't the trail run cold here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "No.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Kal'tsit retrieved the same entry over and over again.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "This is, in itself, some information for us.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A repeated retrieval? Wait, can the infinitely-looping code made from the repeat query count be deciphered too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You already know the answer, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Yes, it's a familiar name.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Perhaps it's a sign...;Perhaps it's a warning...",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never heard of this name. Neither you nor Dr. Kal'tsit has ever said it before\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Priestess'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
