    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "<color=#000000>............</color>",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Doctor, are you seeing what I'm seeing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "...I'm afraid... so...",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "avg_ac8mi_Pre",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$monastery_sad_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "'Priestess...'"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have never seen this scene before, much less seen\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) You're here, {@nickname}.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Is that...?;'Me'...?",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) It took some time to refine your design for PRTS.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oracle"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) I thought you had gone to take a rest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oracle"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) No, I've been thinking about your words this whole time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) 'There is no language that can describe God, as the existence of God itself cannot be understood.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) You know that was just mindless chatter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oracle"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) Suppose I take it as an axiom.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) With it as my starting point, would creating a language that can describe God mean we have the means to understand It?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) Does the prospect not excite you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) Perhaps, in the pursuit of the answer to this question, we have been going down the wrong path\u2014trying to understand the nature of the universe with its own laws.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) You want to use a language wholly created by us to interpret the universe. A far too audacious idea, Priestess.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oracle"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown language) Haha, is it?",
